From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roman Leventov <leventov.ru@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 15:33:50 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 28/31] node: align self-hosted entrypoints with the security
 pin

Align the SDK test workflow and development container with upstream's
Node.js 24.22.1 pin. Backend and dashboard image recipes already derive
their exact NodeSource package from .nvmrc, so resident executors inherit
the same binary without another runtime version selector.

Document that local execution always selects node from PATH and accepts
Node major 24. The former NVM directory search and duplicate .nvmrc.24
selector remain removed. Keep runtime adoption and rollback guidance
aligned with the images.

[skip ci]
